  "content": "<h1>Franchise</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Franchise Opportunities with Arya Bhavan</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>We are excited to announce that Arya Bhavan is now open for franchising! If you’re interested in joining our growing family, please fill out the contact form on our website. Our team will get in touch with you shortly to discuss the next steps.</p><p>We look forward to partnering with passionate individuals ready to bring the Arya Bhavan experience to new locations!</p>\t\t\t\n<p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p> <ul></ul>\n<form action=\"/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php#wpcf7-f1448-o1\" method=\"post\" aria-label=\"Contact form\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" data-status=\"init\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"1448\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"6.0.3\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"en_US\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f1448-o1\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"0\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_posted_data_hash\" value=\"\" />\n<input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Your Name\" value=\"\" type=\"text\" name=\"person-name\" />\n<input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Your Email\" value=\"\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\" />\n<input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Your Phone No.\" value=\"\" type=\"tel\" name=\"tel\" />\n<input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Location\" value=\"\" type=\"text\" name=\"location\" />\n<input type=\"submit\" value=\"Submit\" />\n</form>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Get special offers from us</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t<form method=\"POST\" action=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter Your Email\" autocomplete=\"email\" data-instance-data=\"[]\"/>\n            <a href=\"#\">Subscribe</a>\n\t</form>",
